3.6.0: Direction styles: Interview · 2 cameras (shot/reverse-shot, 3 pictures only = fast), Cinematic film (amber/teal grade, grain, 2.39 letterbox), Newsroom explainer, Phone UGC. Styles are detected from reference ads. Faster export.
